# AiChat Recovery & Context Optimization Plan

## Goal Description
1.  **UI Feedback**: Add a subtle indicator in the Chat Header to show if the background "Librarian" (Enrichment) service is active or has failed (e.g., due to 429s), resolving the "Silent Failure" issue.
2.  **Context Control**: Replace the blind "Safety Truncation" in [providers.ts](file:///c:/Users/artin/Documents/Project-GIGI-Firebase/Project-GIGI/src/services/ai/providers.ts) with a more deliberate context management strategy (e.g., Sliding Window) to ensure valid history is preserved.

